details:
Submissions undergo blind peer review and must:

- address this year's theme;
- not exceed 5,000 words;
- be in Times New Roman, 12 pt, single-spaced, with pagination and a word count;
- follow the Bluebook for footnotes, punctuation, and citation; and
- include a cover letter to the Executive Editor with the author's details, institutional affiliation, and contact number.

Email submissions in DOC or DOCX format to col_journal@wvsu.edu.ph.
